SUMMARY:Mozart’s Da Ponte Operas: Reinventing the Operatic Voice
DESCRIPTION:Soprano Ceferina Perry explores the smartest women in eightee
 nth-century opera\, from Susanna to Despina. A recital in an enthralling
  series on Mozart and Da Ponte's partnership.\nPrice: Tickets £35\nhttp
 s://nearhere.events/events/683bb7265b7fc81a/mozart-s-da-ponte-operas-rei
 nventing-the-operatic-voice
LOCATION:Holy Trinity Sloane Square\, 5 Sloane Terrace London\, England\,
  SW1X 9DQ\, Chelsea\, London
URL:https://nearhere.events/events/683bb7265b7fc81a/mozart-s-da-ponte-ope
 ras-reinventing-the-operatic-voice
END:VEVENT
